    "author id unchanged",
    updatedComment.author.id,
    originalAuthorId,
  );
  TestValidator.equals("author is the user", updatedComment.author.id, user.id);
  // (6) Comment is not deleted
  TestValidator.equals("not soft deleted", updatedComment.deleted_at, null);
}

